        <mxCell id="Rl1y454ElAxmmScd52JP-34" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;fontStyle=0;fontSize=14;" value="Azure Bot waits ~15s for HTTP 200 on POST /api/messages. Bedrock + Eligibility take longer than that. &#xa;&#xa;azure-bot-ingress-lambda must ack and return. A Lambda dies when it returns, so it cannot keep working in the background like a long-lived Node process. &#xa;&#xa;The long work has to be a second invocation: &lt;service&gt;-azure-bot-worker-lambda" vertex="1">
